<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Fighting has resumed in the Kherson region after the longest ceasefire ended, with Russian strikes killing at least 26 people. Russian drones hit a Ukrainian railway station, killing 13, and Russia is fitting makeshift armor of nets and rubber tires to its shadow-fleet drones while deploying decoy drones for one-way attacks up to 1,200 km. Both Ukrainian hackers and Russian actors have compromised emergency alert apps to issue fake nuclear warnings. A Russian Su‑57 fighter was destroyed by an engine fire at Akhtubinsk airfield, and Russian troops have used the Oleshky ceasefire to mask movements. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/cb91f234-85af-4686-9cc5-6f6189e0304c?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/world/europe/russian-strike-zaporizhzhia-ukraine.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/11/3/global-food-security-is-under-threat?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm3wv085ne6po?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg5jlyp66jzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/02/ukraines-stargate-drone-carries-wounded-troops-from-frontline&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168712&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168702&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPdVM1a0dLRmw1LWNRb012WDk0dW80Sy1LMTEta